## SLD Posterior Predictive Check — Uncensored Patients {#sec-sld-ppc}

Replicated vs observed SLD for patients who had a PFS event. Only the observed window is shown — no forecast beyond the event.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
sld_unc |>
  filter(stage == "obs") |>
  plot_sld_forecast_censored() +
  scale_x_continuous("Months", breaks = months_to_weeks(seq(0, 48, 3)), labels = label_weeks_to_months)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Observed vs posterior-predicted SLD for uncensored patients (observation window only).](patient-dynamics_files/figure-html/fig-sld-ppc-1.png){#fig-sld-ppc width=960}
:::
:::


